<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:mda="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:metadata:2.0" version="2.0" srcLang="en" trgLang="uk">
  <file id="dialogs\support\tch_chef.txt" original="dialogs\support\tch_chef.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The Faceless are attacking!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Безликі нападають!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Drawn by the smell, eh, $(#brother/sister)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Приваблений запахом, ех, $(#брате/сестро)?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You must be that novitiate who retrieved the anniversary figurine. Tchort guide you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви повинні бути тим новаком, який повернув ювілейну фігурку. Нехай Тчорт веде вас.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Usually, non-staff in the kitchen are as unwanted as triploidy, but you're new so I'll cut you some slack.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Зазвичай, сторонніх на кухні не хочуть так само, як і триплоїдію, але ви новачок, тому я дам вам трохи послаблень.</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Add... one... more... there it is. Proven!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Додай... ще... одну... ось і все. Доведено!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't you have anything better to do than breathe down my neck?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У вас немає чим зайнятися, крім як дихати мені в спину?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You lost, $(#brother/sister)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви загубилися, $(#брате/сестро)?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Mmmmm... this smells so good even Tchort would be pleased.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мммм... це так добре пахне, навіть Тчорт би був задоволений.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We don't eat anything with tentacles. It's... wrong.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми нічого не їмо з щупальцями. Це... неправильно.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Magnificent Tchort! You standing there won't make me cook faster!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Величний Тчорт! Стояти там не змусить мене готувати швидше!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
  </file>
